<style> .ev-rb{background:#f5f5f0;padding:70px 20px;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif} .ev-rb-inner{max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center} .ev-rb h2{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:#243918;margin:0 0 16px} .ev-rb-sub{font-size:15px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 48px;max-width:700px;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto} .ev-rb-badges{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:32px 40px} .ev-rb-badge{display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;width:120px} .ev-rb-circle{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:50%;border:2px solid #243918;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:10px;background:#fff} .ev-rb-circle svg{width:24px;height:24px} .ev-rb-badge span{font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#333;line-height:1.35;text-align:center} @media(max-width:600px){.ev-rb-badges{gap:24px 20px}.ev-rb-badge{width:calc(33.33% - 14px)}.ev-rb h2{font-size:12px}} </style><div class="ev-rb"><div class="ev-rb-inner"><h2>WETENSCHAPPELIJK ONDERBOUWDE WELZIJNSONDERSTEUNING</h2><p class="ev-rb-sub">Eveom™ Astaxanthine werkt op cellulair niveau om uitgebreid welzijn te ondersteunen — zodat u er beter uitziet,zich beter voelt en beter functioneert in het dagelijks leven.</p><div class="ev-rb-badges"><div class="ev-rb-badge"><div class="ev-rb-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M9 12l2 2 4-4" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M12 3C7.58 3 4 5.69 4 9c0 5.25 8 13 8 13s8-7.75 8-13c0-3.31-3.58-6-8-6z" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="1.5" fill="none"/></svg></div><span>Non-GMO Ingrediënten</span></div><div class="ev-rb-badge"><div class="ev-rb-circle"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M5 12l5 5L19 7" stroke="#243918" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></div><span>Glutenvrije Formule</span></div><div class="ev-rb-badge"><div